        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Evaluate this lead and respond ONLY with a valid JSON object (no markdown backticks, no explanatory text).\n\nInquiry Data:\n- Client Name: {{ $('Validate Input').first().json.client_name }}\n- Company: {{ $('Validate Input').first().json.company_name }}\n- Budget: ${{ $('Validate Input').first().json.project_budget }}\n- Timeline: {{ $('Validate Input').first().json.timeline || \"\" }}\n- Details: {{ $('Validate Input').first().json.project_details || \"\" }}\n\nScoring Rules (0-100 total):\n- budget_score: If budget >= 10000 give 40 points, if >= 5000 give 25, else 10.\n- intent_score: If details show clear goals/urgency give 30 points, else 10.\n- fit_score: If project fits AI/automation services give 30 points, else 10.\n\nReturn EXACTLY this structure:\n{\n  \"budget_score\": 40,\n  \"intent_score\": 30,\n  \"fit_score\": 30,\n  \"summary\": \"Short 1-sentence evaluation\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
